#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:2
msgid "Manage user surveys"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:7
msgid ""
"In a self-hosted Mattermost deployment, you can use the Mattermost User "
"Survey integration to gather direct feedback from your Mattermost users "
"to identify what's working well and what's not with your Mattermost "
"instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:9
msgid ""
"All user responses are stored in and remain within your self-hosted "
"deployment, and no telemetry data is sent back to Mattermost. You can "
"export a CSV report of NPS scores and user responses for further "
"analysis, or to share your feedback data with Mattermost. You can "
"schedule when each survey begins, define how long each survey lasts, "
"specify teams excluded from the survey, as well as customize both a "
"welcome message and a user question you want feedback on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:13
msgid ""
"The User Satisfaction Survey Plugin is the recommended approach for "
"gathering user feedback, replacing the deprecated :doc:`User Satisfaction"
" Survey Plugin </administration-guide/manage/user-satisfaction-surveys>` "
"for new deployments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:16
msgid "Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:18
msgid ""
"You must be a Mattermost system admin to `upload the plugin <#upload>`__ "
"to your Mattermost self-hosted deployment `enable it <#enable>`__,  "
"`create surveys <#create-surveys>`__, and `export survey responses "
"<#export-survey-responses>`__ using the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:20
msgid ""
"The User Survey integration is compatible with Mattermost v9.11.2 or "
"later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:23
msgid "Install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:25
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v9.11.2 (ESR) and Mattermost Cloud v10, this plugin is "
"pre-packaged with the Mattermost Server. If your Mattermost deployment is"
" on a prior release, download the `latest plugin binary release "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-user-survey/releases>`_,"
" and upload it to your server via **System Console > Plugin Management**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:28
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:30
msgid ""
"We recommend updating this integration as new versions are released. "
"Generally, updates are seamless and don't interrupt the user experience "
"in Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:32
msgid ""
"Visit the `Releases page <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"plugin-user-survey/releases>`_ for the latest release, available "
"releases, and compatibiilty considerations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:35
msgid "Enable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:37
msgid ""
"Go to **System Console > Plugins > User Survey** to enable this "
"integration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:39
msgid ""
"Once the integration is installed and enabled, create surveys by "
"completing configuration in the System Console, as described below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:42
msgid "Create surveys"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:44
msgid ""
"Under **Survey setup**, specify the date, time, and details for a new "
"survey:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Send next survey at**: Specify the date and time when the survey will "
"begin rolling out to users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:50
msgid ""
"A single survey can be active at a time. If you already have an active "
"survey running, you'll need to reschedule your new survey to start on a "
"date after the current survey expires. Alternatively, you can end the "
"active survey early by selecting **End survey**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Survey expiry (days)**: Specify how long the survey will be open to "
"responses in days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Exclude specific teams**: Specify who will receive the survey. You can "
"send the survey to all users, to all users on specific teams, or omit all"
" users from specific teams."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:55
msgid ""
"An example of the System Console configuration screen for scheduling a "
"new user survey."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Survey message text**: Customize the introductory message text users "
"see when prompted to complete the survey."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Linear scale question (1-10)**: This question is required that helps "
"calculate the NPS score."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Textual question**: This question is required that helps gather user "
"feedback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Textual question (Optional)**: You can optionally specify a text-based "
"question for your survey."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:62
msgid ""
"Select **Save**. Your new survey is scheduled, and displays under "
"**Active and past surveys** once the survey is shared with users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:64
msgid ""
"An example of the System Console configuration screen for defining the "
"contents of a new user survey."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:68
msgid "Active surveys"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:70
msgid ""
"When a survey starts, all users recieve a direct message from a feedback "
"bot containing the active survey. The survey includes one mandatory "
"scale-based question, and optional text-based questions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:72
msgid "An example of the user survey provided to users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:75
msgid ""
"Users must answer all required questions in order to submit their "
"response. When a user selects **Submit**, their responses are recorded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:78
msgid "Export survey responses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:80
msgid ""
"Select **Export responses** to download a CSV file containing NPS scores "
"and user responses gatherered through the survey. You can export data "
"from active surveys which will contain data collected so far."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/manage-user-surveys.rst:82
msgid ""
"An example of the System Console configuration page where all active and "
"past surveys are available for export."
msgstr ""

